13. Regional Regulation of East Luwu Regency Number 8 of 2016 concerning the Establishment and Composition of Regional Apparatus (Regional Gazette of East Luwu Regency of 2016 Number 8) as amended by Regional Regulation of East Luwu Regency Number 5 of 2020 concerning Amendment to Regional Regulation of East Luwu Regency Number 8 of 2016 concerning the Establishment and Composition of Regional Apparatus (Regional Gazette of East Luwu Regency of 2020 Number 5, Supplement to the Regional Gazette of East Luwu Regency Number 124).

